# Process 3, the body of portal.New: its steps in the order it calls them.
# By hand: dfd --box 300x150 --per-row 5 --number --number-prefix 3. docs/flow.3.dfd -o flow.3.svg

{2 Open the specs directory}
> portal configuration
[3.1. Check the portal configuration
 so that the spec path stays inside the specs directory
 (portal.checkConfig)]
>
[3.2. Load the Elements assets
 or refuse to start without them
 (portal.loadAssets)]
> portal configuration, Elements assets
[3.3. Build the router
 that sends each request to the viewer page, the raw spec or the Elements assets
 (portal.newRouter)]
> portal
{HTTP server}

# type: portal configuration = portal.Config
# type: Elements assets = io/fs.FS
# type: portal = net/http.Handler
